  "word_count": 1096,
  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n# First Visit - McLean, VA\n\n\n\n## You’ll Love How We Treat You Here\n\n\nSchedule Now\n\n\n# First Visit - McLean, VA\n\n\n\n## You’ll Love How We Treat You Here\n\n\nWhy Is An In-House Dental Lab So Important?\n\n\n## Welcome to Dental Group of Tysons!\n\n\nDr. Esam Nahlah and the Dental Group of Tysons team are excited to provide you with a truly unique experience! Expect seasoned dental professionals, minimally invasive laser technology, and a comfortable, welcoming atmosphere. We strive to create a relaxing environment for all our patients, especially those who suffer from dental anxiety, and offer sedation services as needed. With the goal of helping you achieve and maintain exceptional oral health, we offer a comprehensive range of services and treatments in one convenient McLean, VA office. We want proper oral health to be attainable for everyone, which is why we partner with multiple leading insurance providers. Our entire team looks forward to helping you achieve your dream smile with affordable treatment tailored to your needs. We encourage you to read more about what you can expect at your first dental visit, then reserve your appointment with your new McLean, VA dentist!\n\n\n## What To Expect From Your First Visit\n\n\nWe realize that visiting a dental office isn’t always a priority. We take pride in making your dental visits with us as comfortable and personalized as possible! If you’re visiting because of a dental emergency, we may alter the following process, but in general, you should expect:\n\n\n### Warm Welcome\n\n\nThe moment you step inside our office, we’ll be there to welcome you! Our front office staff loves building close relationships with our patients, and we’re excited to bring you into our dental family.\n\n\n### Meet the Team\n\n\nYou’ll be introduced to the team members who’ll be here to provide you with friendly dental care every time you visit our McLean, VA dental office. It’s perfectly all right if you don’t remember the names of our staff, but we make a point to remember yours!\n\n\n### Office Tour\n\n\nWe’ll show you around our office so you can become familiar with where the exam rooms, restrooms, and exits are. We also do our best to provide attentive care, so you’ll rarely be left alone during your appointment.\n\n\n### Consultation\n\n\nThe next step of your appointment is a personalized consultation with our dentist. This is the ideal time to discuss what you like and dislike about your smile as well as any dental issues you may be experiencing.\n\n\n### Digital X-Rays\n\n\nAn important part of your first visit is x-rays. These provide an in-depth view of your oral structures and the high-resolution images enable our dentist to spot small cracks, cavities, and other problems with your teeth.\n\n\n### Examination\n\n\nDr. Nahlah will complete a detailed oral examination of your tissues, gums, bone, and teeth. We’ll check for decay, disease, and infection, and conduct an oral cancer screening.\n\n\n### Hygiene Cleaning\n\n\nFinally, we’ll perform a dental hygiene cleaning. Your new dental hygienist will remove plaque and tartar buildup from your teeth, carefully floss each tooth, then polish your teeth with a gritty toothpaste that leaves them clean and shiny.\n\n\n### Complimentary Gifts\n\n\nYou’ll always leave our office with a few gift items, such as floss or floss-ups, toothpaste, and a new toothbrush. That way you can enjoy your newly cleaned teeth and maintain a proper oral hygiene routine until your next visit!\n\n\n## Providing Affordable Dental Care\n\n\nOur team wants to ensure that all our patients can afford to have healthy smiles for life. We accept many dental insurance plans and are here to help you maximize your benefits. We also partner with third-party dental financing companies that provide low monthly payment plans for costly procedures if you don’t have dental insurance. We’ll help make sure that dental care in McLean, VA is affordable for you and your family!\n\n\n## You are welcome here.\n\n\nSchedule your new patient appointment today.\n\nBook Now\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
